[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3861943346","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115971#issuecomment-3861943346","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115971","id":3861943346,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7mMJQy","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-06T18:20:18Z","updated_at":"2026-02-06T19:24:56Z","body":"Obviously one solution here is \"just re-save all your scenes\", but you have to also somehow understand what the problem is and that this is the fix. If you're working on a large-scale project with hundreds/thousands of scenes this is also less likely to happen naturally, assuming you don't know to run the \"Upgrade Project Files...\" tool after upgrading to 4.6. \n\nIdeally the ID generation for these unique node IDs would be made stable instead, perhaps by seeding it with the UID of the scene along with the node path, or something like that.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3861943346/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"