t/issues/115971#issuecomment-4532693119","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115971","id":4532693119,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDitofw","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-25T08:15:06Z","updated_at":"2026-05-25T08:15:06Z","body":"You're welcome to remove the regression label and/or release blocker project (or just close the issue outright) if you consider running the upgrade tool to be the fix here. I have a hard time imagining that more than a handful of projects out there actually run it, since we don't actually prompt people to do it, but I obviously have no real-world data to base that on.\n\nAlso, as mentioned already, the user would have to realize that:\n\n1. That they are in fact ending up with scene files in their patch PCKs that shouldn't be there.\n2. That these scene files are there as a result of not having been re-saved.\n3. That running the upgrade tool would perform said re-saving.\n\nI think that's a tall order.\n\nIn any case, the severity of this has been lessened somewhat after #116553, as the consequences of non-deterministic exports are now less severe, so I'll go ahead and at least drop this down to \"Not Critical\", but again, you're welcome to remove the regression/blocker labels entirely.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4532693119/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4535557095","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115971#issuecomment-4535557095","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115971","id":4535557095,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDlcb5w","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-25T15:57:58Z","updated_at":"2026-05-25T15:57:58Z","body":"> we don't actually prompt people to do it\n\n#119466 will help with that.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4535557095/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4535996441","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115971#issuecomment-4535996441","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115971","id":4535996441,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDl3QGQ","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-25T17:22:25Z","updated_at":"2026-05-25T17:22:25Z","body":"I'd say \"Not Critical\" is perfectly fine, as we probably shouldn't be hashing editor-only logic to begin with, so it warrants tracking in some capacity","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4535996441/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4539745643","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115971#issuecomment-4539745643","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115971","id":4539745643,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDpcFaw","user":{"login":"danyalahmed1995","id":58849388,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4ODQ5Mzg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58849388?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danyalahmed1995","html_url":"https://github.com/danyalahmed1995","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danyalahmed1995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danyalahmed1995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danyalahmed1995/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danyalahmed1995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danyalahmed1995/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danyalahmed1995/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danyalahmed1995/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danyalahmed1995/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danyalahmed1995/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-26T03:32:19Z","updated_at":"2026-05-26T03:32:19Z","body":"Hey guys , hope Unity is not giving you a tough competition 😄\n\nSo I reproduced this with the MRP on current `master`.\n\nBasically what I found, the unstable part is generated node `unique_id` data ending up in the temporary exported `.scn` for the unsaved upgraded scene. Normal scene save still needs to keep writing those IDs, but the exported runtime scene does not seem to need them outside editor/edit-state bookkeeping.\n\nI re looked at the deterministic-seeding idea mentioned above, but that doesn't seem right, since `Resource::generate_scene_unique_id()` is static and does not know the scene/node context. So I feel like the smaller fix discussed here e.g \"clear the generated node ID data only from the temporary `PackedScene` used during export conversion, right before saving the exported `.scn`\" would be the correct.\n\nThat will also keep normal scene save behavior unchanged, and with this approach repeated exports of `some_other_scene.scn` produce the same hash without re-saving `some_other_scene.tscn`.\n\nDoes that sound right 🤔 ? \n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4539745643/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]